<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's bourse closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Morocco's bourse closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casablanca stock exchange was closed on Thursday for a public holiday along with public offices and private banks in Morocco.</p>
</text>
